OL,3,GNEWSAChocolate mini-eggs thief pulled
OL,4,Aknife on guard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial shoplifter who pulled a knife
OL,7,Fon a security guard while stealing #40
OL,8,Fworth of chocolate has been jailed for
OL,9,Fthree years and four months.
OL,11,FPaul Williams, 43, repeatedly targeted
OL,12,Fshops in Gateshead in December and
OL,13,FJanuary, stealing #701 worth of goods
OL,14,Fincluding meat, seafood, laundry
OL,15,Fproducts and alcohol, Newcastle Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FOn 21 January, Williams pointed a knife
OL,19,Fat a guard who tried to stop him
OL,20,Fleaving with a box of mini-eggs, with
OL,21,Fthe guard saying he was "petrified" he
OL,22,Fcould be stabbed.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
