OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, who already had 150 offences
OL,7,Fon his criminal record and first began
OL,8,Fstealing when he was 12 years old,
OL,9,Fadmitted robbery, possessing a knife
OL,10,Fand seven counts of theft.
